## Remix / iterate

Post-publish refinement uses the **重新混合 / Remix** button (top-right of
the design-system edit view). It opens a chat panel for incremental
adjustment.

For major revisions (brand refresh, new product line), run the intake
skill again, emit `v{{NEXT_VERSION}}`, and upload as a second system
alongside this one.

